@PrivateBlog.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7294
@token = 

### Login JWT (por defecto)
# @name login
POST {{PrivateBlog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "adminuser@yopmail.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "rememberMe": false,
  "useCookie": false
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login con cookie (para pruebas en navegador / mismo host)
POST {{PrivateBlog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "adminuser@yopmail.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "rememberMe": true,
  "useCookie": true
}

### Usuario autenticado (JWT)
GET {{PrivateBlog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Cerrar sesión
POST {{PrivateBlog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar secciones (JWT)
GET {{PrivateBlog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sections?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Obtener sección por id
GET {{PrivateBlog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sections/{{sectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear sección
POST {{PrivateBlog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nueva sección"
}

### Actualizar sección
PUT {{PrivateBlog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sections/{{sectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sección actualizada",
  "isActive": true
}

### Eliminar sección
DELETE {{PrivateBlog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sections/{{sectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Activar sección
POST {{PrivateBlog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sections/{{sectionId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Desactivar sección
POST {{PrivateBlog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sections/{{sectionId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
